## Shadow GNU/Linux - fonts
## Fira Code is used in the terminal/monospace context.
## DejaVu/Liberation provide lightweight GUI fonts.
## Noto Core provides necessary Unicode fallback (e.g. the ☯ prompt symbol).
## ShadowLipibangla.ttf ships via kali-config/common (protected, not default).

fonts-firacode
fonts-dejavu-core
